    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Khorne Daemonkin",
    "summary": "When a **BLOOD LEGIONS** or **WORLD EATERS** unit of yours destroys an enemy unit, you roll a D6: a 3+ earns you 1 BTP (Blood Tithe point). As each Command phase begins, yours or your opponent's, you may spend BTP to activate 1 of these abilities until the battle ends:\n\n- **Enraged Abjuration [2BTP]**: your **BLOOD LEGIONS** and **WORLD EATERS** models have **[Feel No Pain 5+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)** against **mortal wounds** and Psychic Attacks.\n- **Daemonic Rage [3BTP]**: your **BLOOD LEGIONS** units' melee weapons have **[[LANCE]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lance)**.\n- **Boon of Blood [4BTP]**: a 4+ invulnerable save for your **BLOOD LEGIONS** units.\n- **Might of Khorne [5BTP]**: your **BLOOD LEGIONS** units have [Blessings of Khorne](vsdata:ability/world-eaters.blessings-of-khorne).",
